00:24:31.502 --> 00:24:32.462
-Many lovers.

00:24:33.061 --> 00:24:33.883
-Yeah.

00:24:33.883 --> 00:24:35.025
-So walk me through that, man.

00:24:35.025 --> 00:24:37.593
Because look, you're going from...

00:24:38.934 --> 00:24:41.557
