on the planet could say that.

00:25:20.153 --> 00:25:22.725
-Define it. Define it so other people
that might not know what it is.

00:25:22.725 --> 00:25:25.036
-So poly means many, amory means love.

00:25:25.036 --> 00:25:26.627
So it's many loves.

00:25:26.627 --> 00:25:31.855
It's essentially the idea that love
doesn't have to be limited to one person.

00:25:31.855 --> 00:25:34.791
It doesn't have to be monopolized or held

00:25:34.791 --> 00:25:37.527
and it's possible to have
more fluid relationships

00:25:37.527 --> 00:25:40.330
or more complex relationships
than just one man with one woman

00:25:40.330 --> 00:25:42.230
or one man, one man, or whatever.

00:25:42.230 --> 00:25:47.232
It's just the idea that you don't
have to abide by this social custom.

00:25:47.232 --> 00:25:49.062
I think it's better for some people.

00:25:49.062 --> 00:25:51.919
It's not as good for others but ultimately

00:25:51.919 --> 00:25:56.207
I'm pretty sure that 99% of our evolution,
that's how we grew up.

00:25:56.359 --> 00:25:57.903
So it's not something too crazy

00:25:57.903 --> 00:26:02.581
and I think it's unfair to the people
where that comes more naturally to

00:26:02.581 --> 00:26:04.101
that that should be an option for them.

00:26:04.101 --> 00:26:05.415
-Well I think it's honesty, right?

00:26:05.415 --> 00:26:08.312
Like you've always been,
from what I've known of you...

00:26:08.312 --> 00:26:10.547
You've always been straight up,
like, if you're on a date

00:26:10.547 --> 00:26:12.662
