00:26:16.642 --> 00:26:17.904
Sometimes they'll know ahead of time.

00:26:17.904 --> 00:26:20.292
Other times I'll bring it up
at a tactical moment

00:26:20.292 --> 00:26:24.810
just because it's so taboo here
that I really have to frame it.

00:26:24.810 --> 00:26:29.727
Like, I could say the exact same
information to somebody

00:26:29.727 --> 00:26:33.285
and that same person
could perceive it as like,

00:26:33.285 --> 00:26:35.044
"Oh, this person's a horrible monster."

00:26:35.044 --> 00:26:35.555
or

00:26:35.555 --> 00:26:37.834
"Oh, that's actually
really interesting and cool."

00:26:37.834 --> 00:26:40.185
So I can't just be non-tactical about it.

00:26:40.185 --> 00:26:44.163
Especially with women here
who are bred from day one to

00:26:44.163 --> 00:26:47.407
get married and have kids
as young as possible.

00:26:47.985 --> 00:26:51.489
And for even me, it was a big process of

00:26:51.489 --> 00:26:55.133
having to learn, having to mature
and grow to be able to manage that

00:26:55.133 --> 00:26:58.175
and it's all about trust
and communication at the end of the day.

00:26:58.175 --> 00:27:01.017
If you're being sneaky about stuff
or not being forward about things

00:27:01.017 --> 00:27:03.044
-that creates suspicion, jealousy...
-Right.

00:27:03.044 --> 00:27:05.038
-There's mysteries that people
want to fill in the blanks

00:27:05.038 --> 00:27:06.856
when they're uncomfortable
until they know things.

00:27:06.856 --> 00:27:08.695
