or anywhere really.

00:27:11.715 --> 00:27:13.824
-It's just not being spoken, right?
-Yeah

00:27:13.824 --> 00:27:16.795
-Like how many people have you met
that cheat on their partners?

00:27:16.795 --> 00:27:20.233
-I think at least half of guys here
