00:27:20.794 --> 00:27:22.051
From what I can tell.

00:27:22.051 --> 00:27:23.626
-Which is kind of a lot.
-What about at home?

00:27:23.626 --> 00:27:24.849
-I think less.

00:27:24.849 --> 00:27:27.005
I don't know that many people
