00:27:27.005 --> 00:27:28.567
They'll break up or something

00:27:28.567 --> 00:27:31.831
but here it almost seems standard
or not a big deal.

00:27:31.991 --> 00:27:33.791
-So in gen... like...

00:27:34.313 --> 00:27:35.993
With that observation, you're saying

00:27:35.993 --> 00:27:39.029
