00:27:43.041 --> 00:27:45.174
It's kind of like a cousin of polyamory

00:27:45.174 --> 00:27:46.631
and you can have polyamory where

00:27:46.631 --> 00:27:48.687
you can't sleep with other people
but only partners.

00:27:49.421 --> 00:27:52.513
The thing is there's no
black and white answer to it

00:27:52.513 --> 00:27:54.350
because it's different for everybody.

00:27:54.350 --> 00:27:55.916
Some person could be polyamorous

00:27:55.916 --> 00:27:58.660
and be in a monogamous relationship
their whole life

00:27:58.660 --> 00:28:00.501
but they believe in the opportunity that

00:28:00.501 --> 00:28:02.699
