between people I thought were interesting

00:28:53.333 --> 00:28:57.259
and confident, or sort of,
very progressive and this concept.

00:28:57.259 --> 00:28:58.691
And just over time it was like,

00:28:58.691 --> 00:29:00.412
"Hmm, that seems like it makes sense."

00:29:00.412 --> 00:29:03.037
"I don't know people like that but..."

00:29:03.037 --> 00:29:06.256
"...logically, it seems like
a way that people should be."

00:29:06.256 --> 00:29:07.466
-So you're okay...

00:29:07.466 --> 00:29:10.774
If you're amorous you're okay with
your partner going with other guys?

00:29:10.774 --> 00:29:11.631
-Yeah.

00:29:11.631 --> 00:29:16.449
I'll still have jealousy but over time it's
something that I've gotten to curb more.

00:29:16.449 --> 00:29:19.536
I went to Burning Man,
took a workshop on overcoming jealousy.

00:29:19.536 --> 00:29:20.949
Talking to people...

00:29:20.949 --> 00:29:22.969
-'Cause I...
-A prior partner, Manson...

00:29:22.969 --> 00:29:25.923
She was naturally polyamorous
