00:29:28.951 --> 00:29:31.733
Was being with her
because she was older than me

00:29:31.733 --> 00:29:34.026
and had been polyamorous for many years.

00:29:34.026 --> 00:29:35.366
And seeing it functional.

00:29:35.366 --> 00:29:40.495
Like she was married, has kids,
very happy, functional family

00:29:40.495 --> 00:29:43.820
and having that experience
of getting to know the husband

00:29:43.820 --> 00:29:45.463
and actually thinking
he's a really cool guy

00:29:45.463 --> 00:29:47.197
-and being friends with him.
-So wait, wait, wait...

00:29:47.197 --> 00:29:48.353
You got know the hu...

00:29:48.353 --> 00:29:51.946
She was married, had kids,
and you got into a relationship with her?

00:29:51.946 --> 00:29:54.615
-It was not something I ever planned
or imagined in my life.

00:29:54.615 --> 00:29:58.595
That I would be standing
before a girlfriend's kids

00:29:58.595 --> 00:30:01.337
who are like kind of close to my age.

00:30:01.337 --> 00:30:02.814
-And the husband was cool with this?

00:30:02.814 --> 00:30:06.273
-He was, and it's all about people's needs.

00:30:07.183 --> 00:30:12.489
For her, she requires a lot of
