00:30:12.489 --> 00:30:15.696
He's a more stable person that
doesn't have a lot of complicated needs

00:30:15.696 --> 00:30:19.554
and so she appreciates that in him
but it doesn't meet those other needs.

00:30:19.554 --> 00:30:21.661
You're options are to cheat or break up

00:30:21.661 --> 00:30:24.825
or you can be polyamorous
and have everything.

00:30:24.825 --> 00:30:25.825
-Whoa.

00:30:26.302 --> 00:30:32.080
