coming into the household and... [laughs]

00:30:32.080 --> 00:30:33.537
...spending time with his wife?

00:30:33.537 --> 00:30:36.804
-It sounds crazy and it was
f*cking terrifying going in there...

00:30:36.804 --> 00:30:38.611
Like, meeting him the first time.

00:30:38.611 --> 00:30:40.784
He's a senior software engineer

00:30:40.784 --> 00:30:44.158
