00:31:02.775 --> 00:31:05.794
Some people, I think, just aren't
hard-wired to ever be polyamorous.

00:31:05.794 --> 00:31:07.162
-Yeah, I wouldn't be able to handle that.

00:31:07.162 --> 00:31:10.140
-But for some people who can,
it's still going to be a difficult journey.

00:31:10.140 --> 00:31:13.222
I had times where I was so stressed out.

00:31:13.222 --> 00:31:16.507
So much anxiety, some of the worst
