00:31:36.971 --> 00:31:39.260
But that was really stressful

00:31:39.260 --> 00:31:40.999
the first time a friend took me
out of the house

00:31:40.999 --> 00:31:42.837
and he was like,
"You need to get your mind off this."

00:31:42.837 --> 00:31:44.366
and we went out
